fallback":"株式会社のみもの。","id":1,"title":"株式会社のみもの。","title_link":"https://nomimono.co.jp/","text":"『カレーは飲み物。』『なぜ蕎麦にラー油を入れるのか。』『とんかつは飲み物。』『ハンバーグは飲み物。』『焼きそばは飲み物。』などを運営する株式会社のみもの。のホームページです。","blocks":null,"service_name":"nomimono.co.jp","service_icon":"http://nomimono.co.jp/img/favicon.jpg","from_url":"https://nomimono.co.jp/","original_url":"https://nomimono.co.jp/"}],"team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"pA54"}]},{"client_msg_id":"fbb2c0f1-be9c-42ff-915c-46d03ea8a19c","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"あれ「トンテキとハンバーグは飲み物」かな?","ts":"1628809461.461800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"knk"}]},{"client_msg_id":"c8b7fcdc-50e9-42b1-bb87-c4be47a1b5a6","type":"message","user":"U06BRP8VD","text":"同じ運営会社が秋葉原で「トンテキは飲み物。」っていう飲食店をやっていたんですが、いまはそれが「洋食は飲み物。」っていう名前に変わってるんですよね。どう解釈するのがいいんですかね?","ts":"1628809421.461500","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"vHJSt"}]},{"client_msg_id":"69378487-0306-4fd2-b4de-91038db37e51","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"この知見を以後活用していきましょう。","ts":"1628803680.460200","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"/dbIg"}]},{"client_msg_id":"40af1775-eca2-4e8e-9d7a-fc297d655ab4","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"カレーは飲み物、の対偶は、飲み物でないならカレーではない。","ts":"1628803667.459800","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"fcdOq"}]},{"client_msg_id":"619eeaef-a535-4d07-815e-72a7fca3c878","type":"message","user":"U03C4RC8X","text":"浅草などにあるカレーは飲み物という飲食店の名前について考察しました。","ts":"1628803655.459300","team":"T03C4RC8V","replace_original":false,"delete_original":false,"blocks":[{"type":"rich_text","block_id":"DR2if"}]}]
